{
  "uid": "slo-basics",
  "title": "01 · SLO basics — checkout",
  "tags": ["learning", "slo"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "slo",
        "label": "SLO target",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "0.99,0.995,0.998,0.999",
        "current": { "text": "0.998", "value": "0.998" },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "SLI window",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "5m,1h,6h,1d,28d",
        "current": { "text": "1h", "value": "1h" },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**SLI** = good events / all events. **SLO** = the target for that ratio (pick it above). **Error budget** = `1 − SLO`: the share of requests allowed to fail. **Burn rate** = how fast you spend it (1 = exactly on pace to use it all by the end of the window).\n\nBreak things with `curl 'localhost:8091/admin/chaos?error_rate=0.05'` and watch the burn rate. Reset with `?error_rate=0.001&slow_rate=0.005`. Full notes: `01-slo-basics/README.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability SLI ($window)",
      "description": "Share of requests that did NOT return a 5xx over the selected window.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[$window]))\n/\nsum(rate(http_requests_total[$window]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.998 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error budget remaining ($window)",
      "description": "1 − (observed error ratio ÷ allowed error ratio). 100% = untouched, 0% = spent, negative = SLO breached.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - (\n  (1 - sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[$window])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[$window])))\n  /\n  (1 - $slo)\n)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Burn rate (last 1h)",
      "description": "Observed error ratio ÷ allowed error ratio over the last hour. 1 = on pace; 14.4 = would empty a 30-day budget in about 2 days.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(1 - sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[1h])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h])))\n/\n(1 - $slo)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 6 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 14.4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area" }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency SLI: requests < 300ms ($window)",
      "description": "A latency SLI is still a ratio: requests in the le=\"0.3\" histogram bucket ÷ all requests.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{le=\"0.3\"}[$window]))\n/\nsum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count[$window]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.99 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests/sec by status code",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (code) (rate(http_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Burn rate over 5m / 1h / 6h windows",
      "description": "Short windows react fast but are noisy; long windows are steady but slow. Multi-window alerts require both to agree. Dashed lines: 14.4 (page) and 6 (page, slower).",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(1 - sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))) / (1 - $slo)",
          "legendFormat": "5m"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "(1 - sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[1h])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h]))) / (1 - $slo)",
          "legendFormat": "1h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "(1 - sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[6h])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[6h]))) / (1 - $slo)",
          "legendFormat": "6h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" } },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 6 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 14.4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Timeslices: was each 15-minute slice good? (1 = good, 0 = bad)",
      "description": "Timeslice SLO: a slice is good if ≥ 99% of its requests succeeded. The SLO is then 'share of good slices', not 'share of good requests'.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 17, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "interval": "15m",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[15m])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[15m])) >= bool 0.99",
          "legendFormat": "slice good?"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "min": 0, "max": 1, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60 } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Good slices over $window",
      "description": "avg_over_time of the 1/0 slice series = fraction of good slices. Empty for 5m because no full 15m slice fits.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 17, "w": 4, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "avg_over_time(\n  (sum(rate(http_requests_total{code!~\"5..\"}[15m])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[15m])) >= bool 0.99)[$window:15m]\n)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.998 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency percentiles (for contrast)",
      "description": "Percentiles are good for debugging but bad SLIs: you can't add or average them across windows. The ratio-based latency SLI can be.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 17, "w": 8, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] }
    }
  ]
}
